Third-party notices
-------------------

This repository contains no dataset files, nor model weights. Data must be
downloaded separately and must not be committed to this repository.

AerialWaste dataset
  License : CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
            https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/
  Source  : https://aerialwaste.org
  Citation: Torres & Fraternali, "AerialWaste dataset for landfill discovery
            in aerial and satellite images", Scientific Data 10:63, 2023.
            https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-023-01976-9

AerialWaste model weights (authors' checkpoint)
  License : CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 — non-commercial use only, no redistribution
            of adapted material.
  Source  : https://github.com/nahitorres/aerialwaste-model

Prithvi-EO-2.0 model weights
  License : Apache 2.0
            https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Source  : https://huggingface.co/ibm-nasa-geospatial/Prithvi-EO-2.0-300M
  Citation: Szwarcman et al., "Prithvi-EO-2.0: A Versatile Multi-Temporal
            Foundation Model for Earth Observation Applications",
            arXiv:2412.02732, 2024.

Trained model weights (this repo, fine-tuned on AerialWaste)
  Because the training data is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, any model weights derived
  from it are subject to the same terms: non-commercial use only, no
  redistribution of adapted material.

Google Earth imagery (subset of AerialWaste)
  The AerialWaste dataset includes imagery derived from Google Earth.
  Use of that imagery is subject to the Google Earth / Google Maps Terms of
  Service: https://about.google/brand-resource-center/products-and-services/geo-guidelines/
  That imagery must NOT be stored in this repository, redistributed, or used
  for purposes beyond personal non-commercial research without explicit written
  permission from Google.
